  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot gelecek sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Gelecek i\xE7in \"De\u011Fnek Onlusu\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nArt\u0131k
    hayalini kurdu\u011Fun g\xFCnlere \xE7ok yak\u0131ns\u0131n {{isim}}. Belki \xFC\xE7
    be\u015F ad\u0131m, belki de daha az var. Fakat kamburunun \xE7\u0131kt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. \xC7ok yorulmu\u015Fsun. Bir ad\u0131m daha atmaya mecalinin
    kalmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6yl\xFCyor kart\u0131n. Omuzlar\u0131nda
    bunca sorumlulukla ve bu manevi y\xFCklerle o son noktaya varman pek m\xFCmk\xFCn
    g\xF6z\xFCkm\xFCyor. Se\xE7ti\u011Fin kart, a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131klar\u0131n
    biraz\u0131ndan kurtulman\u0131n ak\u0131ll\u0131ca olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    s\xF6yl\xFCyor. Baz\u0131 \u015Feyleri orac\u0131kta b\u0131rakmal\u0131, baz\u0131
    insanlar\u0131 es ge\xE7meli ve ilerlemelisin. Senin i\xE7in \u015Fu an \xF6nemli
    olan sonu\xE7. E\u011Fer bunu yapmazsan, bu y\xFCk\xFCn alt\u0131nda kal\u0131rs\u0131n.
    O durumda da tek se\xE7ene\u011Fin \"vazge\xE7mek\" olur. Bence bunu yapma."
